title: "The AI Literacy Divide: Access, Capability, and Inequality in the Age of Generative AI"
authors:
  - family-names: "Bhal Chandra"
    given-names: "Binayak"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0005-7901-0926"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-03"
url: "https://github.com/binayakverz/the-ai-literacy-divide"
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.23103700"
license: "CC-BY-4.0"
abstract: >-
  This research examines disparities in access, perceived AI literacy,
  capability, effective use, and realised benefit in the age of generative AI.
  It combines a comparative quantitative analysis of individual-level FITPED
  AI Literacy questionnaire data with a structured synthesis of independent
  international indicators. The repository provides the research manuscript,
  figures, methodological documentation, references, and supporting materials.
keywords:
  - artificial intelligence
  - AI literacy
  - generative AI
  - digital inequality
  - digital divide
  - research reproducibility
